sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Shop
    participant Warehouse
    participant Payment as Payment provider
    participant Mailer
    Customer->>Shop: 1. places an order: cart, coupon, address, VAT ID
    Shop->>Shop: 2. prices the order: six rules
    Shop->>Warehouse: 3. reserves the parcel
    Warehouse-->>Shop: 4. Reserved or OutOfStock
    Shop->>Payment: 5. charges the total
    Payment-->>Shop: 6. Charged or Declined
    Shop->>Mailer: 7. sends the confirmation
    Mailer-->>Shop: 8. Sent or Bounced
    Shop-->>Customer: 9. Accepted or Rejected
